        q: "નીચેનું કોષ્ટક ભારતમાં 1991 - 1997 સુધીમાં ભારતની કુલ પાવર/ઊર્જા તંગી દર્શાવે છે. આ માહિતીને આલેખ સ્વરૂપે દર્શાવો. Y - અક્ષ ઉપર વર્ષ મુજબ તંગીની ટકાવારીને તથા X - અક્ષ ઉપર વર્ષને દર્શાવો :",
        ans: "<p>નીચે આપેલ આલેખ મોબાઈલ સ્ક્રીન પર <b>ડાબી-જમણી બાજુ સ્ક્રોલ</b> કરી શકાશે:</p><div style='overflow-x:auto; background-color:#f4f7f6; border:1px solid #c8d6e5; border-radius:10px; padding:20px; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);'><h4 style='text-align:center; color:#2c3e50; margin-bottom:20px; font-family:sans-serif;'>ભારતમાં પાવર/ઊર્જાની તંગી (1991 - 1997)</h4><div style='display:flex; align-items:flex-end; justify-content:space-around; height:280px; min-width:600px; border-bottom:3px solid #34495e; border-left:3px solid #34495e; padding-bottom:0px; position:relative; margin-left:40px; margin-bottom:30px;'><div style='position:absolute; left:-40px; top:0; height:100%; display:flex; flex-direction:column; justify-content:space-between; font-size:13px; color:#7f8c8d; font-weight:bold;'><span>12%</span><span>9%</span><span>6%</span><span>3%</span><span>0%</span></div><div style='position:absolute; left:0; right:0; top:0%; border-top:1px dashed #bdc3c7; z-index:0;'></div><div style='position:absolute; left:0; right:0; top:25%; border-top:1px dashed #bdc3c7; z-index:0;'></div><div style='position:absolute; left:0; right:0; top:50%; border-top:1px dashed #bdc3c7; z-index:0;'></div><div style='position:absolute; left:0; right:0; top:75%; border-top:1px dashed #bdc3c7; z-index:0;'></div><div style='display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; width:50px; z-index:1;'><span style='font-size:13px; font-weight:bold; color:#e74c3c; margin-bottom:5px;'>7.9%</span><div style='height:184px; width:100%; background:linear-gradient(to top, #3498db, #2980b9); border-radius:6px 6px 0 0; transition: height 0.5s ease;'></div><span style='margin-top:10px; font-size:14px; font-weight:bold; color:#2c3e50;'>1991</span></div><div style='display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; width:50px; z-index:1;'><span style='font-size:13px; font-weight:bold; color:#e74c3c; margin-bottom:5px;'>7.8%</span><div style='height:182px; width:100%; background:linear-gradient(to top, #9b59b6, #8e44ad); border-radius:6px 6px 0 0;'></div><span style='margin-top:10px; font-size:14px; font-weight:bold; color:#2c3e50;'>1992</span></div><div style='display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; width:50px; z-index:1;'><span style='font-size:13px; font-weight:bold; color:#e74c3c; margin-bottom:5px;'>8.3%</span><div style='height:193px; width:100%; background:linear-gradient(to top, #1abc9c, #16a085); border-radius:6px 6px 0 0;'></div><span style='margin-top:10px; font-size:14px; font-weight:bold; color:#2c3e50;'>1993</span></div><div style='display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; width:50px; z-index:1;'><span style='font-size:13px; font-weight:bold; color:#e74c3c; margin-bottom:5px;'>7.4%</span><div style='height:172px; width:100%; background:linear-gradient(to top, #f1c40f, #f39c12); border-radius:6px 6px 0 0;'></div><span style='margin-top:10px; font-size:14px; font-weight:bold; color:#2c3e50;'>1994</span></div><div style='display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; width:50px; z-index:1;'><span style='font-size:13px; font-weight:bold; color:#e74c3c; margin-bottom:5px;'>7.1%</span><div style='height:165px; width:100%; background:linear-gradient(to top, #e67e22, #d35400); border-radius:6px 6px 0 0;'></div><span style='margin-top:10px; font-size:14px; font-weight:bold; color:#2c3e50;'>1995</span></div><div style='display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; width:50px; z-index:1;'><span style='font-size:13px; font-weight:bold; color:#e74c3c; margin-bottom:5px;'>9.2%</span><div style='height:214px; width:100%; background:linear-gradient(to top, #e74c3c, #c0392b); border-radius:6px 6px 0 0;'></div><span style='margin-top:10px; font-size:14px; font-weight:bold; color:#2c3e50;'>1996</span></div><div style='display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; width:50px; z-index:1;'><span style='font-size:13px; font-weight:bold; color:#e74c3c; margin-bottom:5px;'>11.5%</span><div style='height:268px; width:100%; background:linear-gradient(to top, #2ecc71, #27ae60); border-radius:6px 6px 0 0;'></div><span style='margin-top:10px; font-size:14px; font-weight:bold; color:#2c3e50;'>1997</span></div></div><div style='text-align:center; font-weight:bold; color:#34495e; font-size:15px; margin-top:-10px;'>X - અક્ષ : વર્ષ (Years)</div><div style='position:absolute; left:-15px; top:50%; transform:rotate(-90deg); font-weight:bold; color:#34495e; font-size:15px; transform-origin: left center;'>Y - અક્ષ : તંગી (%)</div></div><br><div style='background-color:#e1f5fe; border-left:5px solid #03a9f4; padding:10px; margin-top:10px; border-radius:4px;'>💡 <span style='color:#01579b;'><b>નિતેશ સરની ટિપ્સ:</b><br>આલેખ જોતાં જ ખબર પડે છે કે <b>1997 માં ટાવર સૌથી ઊંચો છે (11.5%)</b>, મતલબ તે વર્ષે દેશમાં પાવરની સૌથી વધુ તંગી (અછત) હતી! જ્યારે 1995 માં સૌથી ઓછી તંગી હતી.</span></div>"
